Functional Requirements
Data Collection
The system shall:
Collect Google Play Store reviews using the google-play-scraper library.
Collect Apple App Store reviews using the iTunes RSS Review Feed.
Scrape Reddit posts and top comments using relevant search queries.
Collect publicly available discussions from community forums.
Collect social media conversations wherever publicly accessible.
Collect product review discussions.
Collect quick-commerce related discussions.
The collected dataset shall contain:
Column
source
date
rating
text
url

The data should be stored as:
reviews_raw.csv

Data Cleaning
The engine should:
Remove duplicate reviews.
Remove duplicate discussions.
Remove advertisements.
Remove empty records.
Remove entries containing fewer than six words.
Normalize whitespace and formatting.
Preserve source information.
Target dataset size:
1500+ unique reviews/discussions

Theme Discovery
Using AI/NLP techniques, the system should:
Identify recurring customer themes.
Group semantically similar themes.
Merge duplicate themes from different sources.
Store intermediate results in:
themes_raw.json

Theme Aggregation
For every merged theme, calculate:
Theme name
Description
Frequency count
Number of sources where the theme appeared
Example customer quotes
Save as:
themes_summary.csv

Theme Ranking
Rank themes according to:
Total frequency
Number of different sources
Display the:
Top 10 recurring themes

Theme Validation
To ensure insights are evidence-based rather than AI-generated assumptions, perform keyword-based validation by:
Matching keywords associated with each theme against the raw dataset.
Calculating the percentage of reviews discussing each theme.
Adding:
validation_pct
to themes_summary.csv.

Insight Generation
Generate concise presentation-ready insights for the top themes.
Example:
Delivery reliability remains the strongest driver of customer loyalty, appearing in 42% of validated user discussions.
Each insight should include:
Theme
Insight sentence
Validation percentage

